      "raw_text": "LED TRUCK FOR KOLETTE ALBUM LAUNCH 🎉🚛\n\nGet ready to spot our Mobile LED truck display roaming around North EDSA today in support of Kolette's album launch! 🚚📺 For 8 hours, the truck will be showcasing Kolette's music and artistry, and we want YOU to be part of the fun! 📸📹 If you see the truck, snap a photo or video, post, share and  tag @kolettemadelo @starmagicphils and @StarMusicPH 📱 By doing so, you might just win FREE merch! 🎁 \n\nLet's come together to support Kolette and make her songs known! 🙌 A huge thank to our very generous sponsors for making this possible - we're so grateful! The unity and eagernes is on fire🔥#KoletteAlbumLaunch #MobileLED #SupportKolette",
